  "applicationProcess": [
   {
    "mode": "Online",
    "process": [
     {
      "children": [
       {
        "children": [
         {
          "bold": true,
          "text": "Registration Process:"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "children": [
         {
          "bold": true,
          "text": "Step 01:"
         },
         {
          "text": " To avail of the benefits of the scheme, the applicant needs to visit "
         },
         {
          "children": [
           {
            "text": "SUNEETHI- Online Service Application Portal"
           }
          ],
          "link": "https://suneethi.sjd.kerala.gov.in",
          "type": "link"
         },
         {
          "text": ""
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "children": [
         {
          "bold": true,
          "text": "Step 02:"
         },
         {
          "text": " On the home page, click on “One time Registration”"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "children": [
         {
          "bold": true,
          "text": "Step 03:"
         },
         {
          "text": " Fill in the details like Name, Email ID & Mobile Number and click on ‘Register’."
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "children": [
         {
          "bold": true,
          "text": "Step 04:"
         },
         {
          "text": " The applicant needs to enter the verification code received on the mobile number and click on ‘Verify’."
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "children": [
         {
          "bold": true,
          "text": "Step 05:"
         },
         {
          "text": " Now, a form will open to create the new profile, fill in all the mandatory details and click on ‘Register’."
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "children": [
         {
          "text": "Login/Application Process: "
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "children": [
         {
          "bold": true,
          "text": "Step 01:"
         },
         {
          "text": " Once the registration process is completed, the applicant should visit "
         },
         {
          "children": [
           {
            "text": "SUNEETHI- Online Service Application Portal"
           }
          ],
          "link": "https://suneethi.sjd.kerala.gov.in",
          "type": "link"
         },
         {
          "text": " and click on “Citizen Login”."
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "children": [
         {
          "bold": true,
          "text": "Step 02:"
         },
         {
          "text": " Enter the user name i.e. Mobile Number and Password and click on “Sign in”."
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "children": [
         {
          "bold": true,
          "text": "Step 03:"
         },
         {
          "text": " Now, the applicant needs to update all their details i.e. Personal Information, Contact Details, Identity Cards & Bank Details by clicking on the 'Edit' button."
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "children": [
         {
          "bold": true,
          "text": "Step 04: "
         },
         {
          "text": "Once the applicant updated their profile successfully, the schemes will appear on the left side of the screen."
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "children": [
         {
          "bold": true,
          "text": "Step 05:"
         },
         {
          "text": " Select the scheme and click on the “Apply Now” button."
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "children": [
         {
          "bold": true,
          "text": "Step 06:"
         },
         {
          "text": " Fill in all the mandatory details in the application form and click on the ‘Submit’ button."
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "align_justify"
     }
    ],
    "process_md": "**Registration Process:**\n**Step 01:** To avail of the benefits of the scheme, the applicant needs to visit [SUNEETHI- Online Service Application Portal](https://suneethi.sjd.kerala.gov.in)\n**Step 02:** On the home page, click on “One time Registration”\n**Step 03:** Fill in the details like Name, Email ID &amp;amp; Mobile Number and click on ‘Register’.\n**Step 04:** The applicant needs to enter the verification code received on the mobile number and click on ‘Verify’.\n**Step 05:** Now, a form will open to create the new profile, fill in all the mandatory details and click on ‘Register’.\nLogin/Application Process: \n**Step 01:** Once the registration process is completed, the applicant should visit [SUNEETHI- Online Service Application Portal](https://suneethi.sjd.kerala.gov.in) and click on “Citizen Login”.\n**Step 02:** Enter the user name i.e. Mobile Number and Password and click on “Sign in”.\n**Step 03:** Now, the applicant needs to update all their details i.e. Personal Information, Contact Details, Identity Cards &amp;amp; Bank Details by clicking on the &amp;#39;Edit&amp;#39; button.\n**Step 04:** Once the applicant updated their profile successfully, the schemes will appear on the left side of the screen.\n**Step 05:** Select the scheme and click on the “Apply Now” button.\n**Step 06:** Fill in all the mandatory details in the application form and click on the ‘Submit’ button.\n",
    "url": "https://suneethi.sjd.kerala.gov.in"
   },
